## Which employee life stage has the highest risk?
SQL query :
SELECT
MaritalStatus,
COUNT(*) AS overAllEmployee,
SUM(CASE WHEN Attrition = TRUE THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS totalAttrition,
ROUND((SUM(CASE WHEN Attrition = TRUE THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)/COUNT(*))*100,2) AS attritionRate
FROM `hr-attrition-and-performance.hrData.data`
GROUP BY MaritalStatus
ORDER BY ROUND((SUM(CASE WHEN Attrition = TRUE THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)/COUNT(*))*100,2) DESC
Result :
Single -> attritionRate 25.53
Married -> attritionRate 12.48
Divorce -> attritionRate 10.09

## Does compensation growth reduce attrition?
SQL query :
SELECT
Attrition,
ROUND(AVG(PercentSalaryHike),2) AS salaryHike
FROM `hr-attrition-and-performance.hrData.data`
GROUP BY Attrition
ORDER BY AVG(PercentSalaryHike)
Result :
Yes -> avg. salaryHike 15.10
No -> avg. salaryHike 15.23

